# https://github.com/browserslist/browserslist#readme
#
# Angular's own default (Baseline Widely available), raised to Bootstrap 6's
# minimum browsers from https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/main/.browserslistrc
#
# Bootstrap's file isn't copied as-is: its `last 2 major versions` and
# `unreleased versions` queries add browsers Angular doesn't support (Opera,
# Samsung Internet, Safari TP, unreleased Chrome), so every build warns.
# Excluding older versions from Angular's list keeps every target inside both
# support policies. Check with `npx browserslist` after any change.

baseline widely available
not Chrome < 130
not Edge < 130
not Firefox < 132
not iOS < 18
not Safari < 18
